# Kalshi

Full skill: `docs/skills/kalshi.md`

- Base `https://external-api.kalshi.com/trade-api/v2`
- Priority fetch: `KXBTC15M`, `KXETH15M` first, then `KXBTCD` / `KXETHD` at concurrency 2.
- 15m = one binary vs CF print. Hourly = above/below ladder; implied spot is the 50¢ crossing.
- Candles: `GET /series/{series}/markets/{ticker}/candlesticks`. Intervals **1, 60, 1440 only**. 15m and τ < 2d → interval **1**.
- 15m countdown: no `Date.now()` on first paint (hydration).
- Settled prints: `GET /events?status=settled&series_ticker=KXBTC15M|KXETH15M`
